    "body": "Found during #12 work (pre-existing). UorR4Router::export_state serializes self with serde_json::to_string and unwrap_or_default(); MultiFacetStore uses HashMap<Vec<u32>, _> whose keys cannot serialize as JSON object keys, so serialization errors and the unwrap_or_default silently returns \"\". The default corpus always populates the facet store, so export_state() effectively always returns empty today. Fix options: serialize the facet store as an array of (key, values) pairs, or skip it with serde(skip) + explicit re-export path. crates/uor-r4-router/src/lib.rs.",
