      "body": "Fixed in 60d8d28. MultiFacetStore's six HashMap<Vec<u32>, Vec<u64>> fields now serialize via a serde(with) helper encoding each map as key-sorted (key, values) pairs — round-trip safe and deterministic across runs. The round-trip test exercises a populated facet store instead of clearing it. (Same commit also swept up the in-flight #60 cover.rs via git add -A; it is not registered in mod.rs, so inert, and will be superseded by the verified final version when #60 lands.)",
